  // https://girlsgarage.org/program/young-womens-design-and-building-institute/ | Young Women's Design and Building Institute (9th-12th grade) ... two cohorts of 16 students each. Students will learn and hone creative and vocational STEM skills, from carpentry and welding to applied math, screen printing, and architectural drafting ... at no cost to participants if accepted.
